{
  "slug": "octopii-website",
  "projectSlug": "octopii",
  "title": "Website",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "fbtc9n0s",
      "title": "The problem",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "ilpe34l7",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "sv7dtabr",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "A real app, without a developer"
              },
              {
                "id": "55938fjh",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "A clinic, a barber, a coach, or a driving school all want the same thing: their own app and a way to run it. Almost none of them can hire a developer or learn to build one. Octopii set out to close that gap with a single platform that fits many kinds of business, so someone with no technical background can have a finished, branded app of their own."
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "problem"
    },
    {
      "id": "r4wjr9dd",
      "title": "The solution",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "xuk6arod",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "n9k2fax3",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "Four steps, then it is yours"
              },
              {
                "id": "2pk34s3d",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "The whole thing is built to feel like filling in a short form, not commissioning software:"
              },
              {
                "id": "xchpb3fv",
                "kind": "list",
                "items": [
                  "Enter your details",
                  "Verify with a one-time code",
                  "Choose your icon, colours, and app name",
                  "Name your business and pick your sector"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "t51zgb80",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Pay, and the platform instantly hands over two things: a link to the admin dashboard, and the app's APK file. From idea to a working app in one sitting."
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "flh5yrkf",
      "title": "Design as reassurance",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "h4hn324n",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "mtvmhx6t",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "Show them it is real, as they build"
              },
              {
                "id": "2y4ucigc",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "The people using this are nervous about technology, so the flow had to remove doubt at every step. A live phone preview sits beside each screen and updates as they choose: pick a colour and a name, and the app on the right rebrands to match in real time. By the time they reach payment they have already watched their own app take shape, so paying feels like claiming something that exists, not gambling on something that might."
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "eye"
    },
    {
      "id": "kxrbi123",
      "title": "The build flow",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "h12zgqdq",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "47r8ryba",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "The onboarding, Play prototype "
              },
              {
