    },
    {
      "id": "dmaz3ir5",
      "title": "Two owners, one product ",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "4pfco9l7",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "wcn5e5v6",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "An admin inside an admin"
              },
              {
                "id": "kiy09nc8",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "The hardest part was not the four steps. It was that Octopii serves two levels of control at once, and both had to be designed:"
              },
              {
                "id": "e2mnkbyh",
                "kind": "list",
                "items": [
                  "The business owner runs their own app from a client admin: adding the services they offer, their prices, and their names.",
                  "Octopii runs the whole platform from a company admin, managing every client's product above them."
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "8vkeab2o",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Designing one system that keeps those two roles clear, without either one seeing controls that are not theirs, is the real product behind the friendly four-step face."
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "layers"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9r3dr4c",
      "title": "The surfaces",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "2ooko96g",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "qj38vl42",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "What I designed"
              },
              {
                "id": "k2c19omh",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Across the project I designed the full surface: the marketing website that explains the promise, the app-builder flow that delivers it, the app that gets handed to the business, and both admin panels behind it. One product, four faces, held to a single visual language."
              },
              {
